// The spirits M1's rituals and signets create (T4.3.7).
// Health and armor are A-015: 20 health per level (times 1 + 4% per rank of the
// creator's Spawning Power) and 2 + 6 armor per level, from the wiki's unofficial
// figures; hostile spirits have 100 armor in hard mode.
